---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — The Money Margin"
  description="Privacy Policy for The Money Margin. Information regarding cookies, data usage, analytics, and third-party advertising including Google AdSense."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-12">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <div class="mb-8 font-sans">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5C6B7A] mb-4">
        <a href={`${base}/`} class="hover:text-[#E67E22] transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[#E67E22] font-bold">Privacy Policy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B3C] font-sans tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-sans font-semibold text-[#5C6B7A] mt-2">
        Last Updated: August 18, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Policy Content -->
    <div class="font-serif text-[#1A2B3C] text-base sm:text-lg leading-[1.8] space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          1. Introduction
        </h2>
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>The Money Margin</strong> (accessible at <a href="https://themoneymargin.com" class="text-[#E67E22] hover:underline">themoneymargin.com</a>). This website is a personal finance publication managed by Daniel Reyes based in Austin, Texas. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any personal data you share with us or that is collected when you visit this website.
        </p>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy outlines the types of information we collect, how it is used, and the steps we take to safeguard your privacy when you read our articles, use our forms, or interact with our site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          2. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>We may collect and process the following categories of information:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Voluntary Contact Information:</strong> When you send an email or submit a message through our contact form, we collect your name, email address, and the contents of your message.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Log & Device Data:</strong> Like most websites, our servers automatically log certain non-personally identifiable information, such as your IP address, browser type, referring URLs, operating system, and timestamp of your visit.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cookies and Web Beacons:</strong> Small data files placed on your device to enhance site navigation, remember preferences, and analyze aggregate visitor trends.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          3. How We Use Information
        </h2>
        <p>We use the collected data exclusively for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
          <li>To respond to your inquiries, feedback, and reader questions.</li>
          <li>To ensure the technical stability, security, and performance of the website.</li>
          <li>To analyze overall reader traffic patterns and improve article clarity and usefulness.</li>
          <li>To display relevant advertisements through verified advertising networks.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          4. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising
        </h2>
        <p>
          This website may display advertisements served by <strong>Google AdSense</strong> and other third-party advertising partners.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
          <li>
            Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies (including the DoubleClick cookie) to serve ads to users based on their visits to this website and other sites across the Internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve personalized ads to our visitors based on their browsing history.
          </li>
          <li>
            You may opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#E67E22] hover:underline font-semibold">Google Ads Settings</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor’s use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#E67E22] hover:underline font-semibold">AboutAds.info Choices page</a> or the <a href="https://www.networkadvertising.org/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#E67E22] hover:underline font-semibold">Network Advertising Initiative</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          5. Analytics & Performance Tracking
        </h2>
        <p>
          We may use privacy-conscious analytics tools to track aggregate performance (such as page views, bounce rates, and average time spent on articles). These analytics do not track individual users across unrelated websites and do not sell personal data to data brokers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          6. Your Rights & Cookie Management
        </h2>
        <p>
          You have full control over your data. Most web browsers allow you to modify cookie settings, block third-party cookies, or delete cookies already stored on your device. Note that disabling cookies may slightly affect the presentation of certain pages.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have contacted us via email or our form and wish to request the deletion of your email correspondence from our records, you may email us directly at any time.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          7. Contact Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions, comments, or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please reach out directly:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#F3EFEA] border border-[#E8E2D9] font-sans text-sm">
          <p class="font-bold text-[#1A2B3C]">The Money Margin</p>
          <p class="text-[#5C6B7A]">Editor: Daniel Reyes</p>
          <p class="text-[#5C6B7A]">Location: Austin, Texas, United States</p>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Email: <a href="mailto:wrwanshenchen@gmail.com" class="text-[#E67E22] font-semibold hover:underline font-mono">wrwanshenchen@gmail.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
